IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ohsr-dates`
IMPORT `ohsr-core`
IMPORT `ohsr-seat`

-- Occupational Health and Safety Regulations 2017 (Vic) -- cases for the seat of the worker: hazardous substances
-- (Part 4.1), scheduled carcinogenic substances (Part 4.2), lead (Part 4.3), asbestos (Part 4.4), crystalline silica
-- (Part 4.5) and construction (Part 5.1), with the three regulative rules (rr 195(1), 200(1), 355(1)). Every expected
-- value was worked by hand from the deposited text (Version No. 018), with the regulation in the comment; none was copied
-- from the encoding's output.
--
-- BASELINE. Not for public use as advice. See NOTES.md.

GIVEN `dd` IS A NUMBER
      `mm` IS A NUMBER
      `yy` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`day` `dd` `mm` `yy` MEANS DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY `dd` `mm` `yy`)

GIVEN `dd` IS A NUMBER
      `mm` IS A NUMBER
      `yy` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DATE
`on` `dd` `mm` `yy` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY `dd` `mm` `yy`

-- The day a MAYBE DATE answer names, or 0 for NOTHING.
GIVEN `the answer` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the day named by` `the answer` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the answer`
    WHEN JUST `x` THEN DATE_SERIAL `x`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN 0

-- r 169 with Schedule 9 and r 154(2). Inputs: substance, Authority-determined, reasonably likely adverse, lead process.
#ASSERT `Must my employer arrange health monitoring for me` `crystalline silica` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Must my employer arrange health monitoring for me` `crystalline silica` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Must my employer arrange health monitoring for me` `another hazardous substance` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Must my employer arrange health monitoring for me` `another hazardous substance` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Must my employer arrange health monitoring for me` `lead` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Must my employer arrange health monitoring for me` `lead` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Must my employer arrange health monitoring for me` `benzene` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
