#ASSERT `Was I exposed above the exposure standard` TRUE 1 1.01 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Was I exposed above the exposure standard` FALSE 1 5 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- r 166. Inputs: standard exists, uncertainty, needed to tell risk, biological health monitoring required.
