-- r 5 "construction excavation": a trench deeper than 1·5 metres (the deposit corrected 2026-11-07, NOTES.md finding 1), a
-- shaft deeper than 2 metres, any tunnel. Edges: 1.5 and 1.6 m trench, 2 and 2.1 m shaft, a 1 m trench a person can enter.
#ASSERT `Must WorkSafe be notified of the excavation` `a trench` 1.5 TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Must WorkSafe be notified of the excavation` `a trench` 1.6 TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Must WorkSafe be notified of the excavation` `a trench` 1 TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Must WorkSafe be notified of the excavation` `a shaft` 2 TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Must WorkSafe be notified of the excavation` `a shaft` 2.1 TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- r 355(1) by EVALTRACE: notice on 1 November, work may begin on 4 November, not on 3 November.
#ASSERT `Was WorkSafe notified of the excavation in time` `a trench` 2 TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE (`on` 1 11 2026) (`on` 4 11 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Was WorkSafe notified of the excavation in time` `a trench` 2 TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE (`on` 1 11 2026) (`on` 3 11 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was WorkSafe notified of the excavation in time` `a trench` 2 TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE (`on` 1 11 2026) (`on` 1 11 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was WorkSafe notified of the excavation in time` `a trench` 2 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (`on` 1 11 2026) (`on` 9 11 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was WorkSafe notified of the excavation in time` `a trench` 2 TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE (`on` 1 11 2026) (`on` 31 10 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was WorkSafe notified of the excavation in time` `a trench` 2 TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE (`on` 1 11 2026) (`on` 2 11 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Was WorkSafe notified of the excavation in time` `another excavation` 2 TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE (`on` 1 11 2026) (`on` 9 11 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Not a construction excavation (a 1 m trench): r 355(1) does not apply, so no timing answer (F25).
#ASSERT `Was WorkSafe notified of the excavation in time` `a trench` 1 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (`on` 1 11 2026) (`on` 2 11 2026) EQUALS NOTHING

-- The three regulative rules, traced directly.
-- expect: FULFILLED (notice on the 7th day after the identification)
#TRACE `r 195(1) -- notice of lead-risk work within 7 days` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `notify the Authority in writing of the lead-risk work` AT 7
-- expect: BREACH by the employer (no notice; the 8th day passes)
#TRACE `r 195(1) -- notice of lead-risk work within 7 days` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the worker` DOES `wait` AT 8
-- expect: FULFILLED (examination on the 7th day after the removal)
#TRACE `r 200(1) -- medical examination within 7 days after removal` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `provide a medical examination by a registered medical practitioner` AT 7
-- expect: FULFILLED (excavation begins on the 3rd day after the notice)
#TRACE `r 355(1) -- no excavation work until 3 days after the notice` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `commence the construction excavation work` AT 3
-- expect: BREACH by the employer (excavation begins on the 2nd day after the notice)
#TRACE `r 355(1) -- no excavation work until 3 days after the notice` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `commence the construction excavation work` AT 2
